# Project-level ignore rules. `.loreignore` is sovereign over what Lore
# indexes (D-0020), so it can re-include paths that .gitignore excludes.

# graft's context graph. /graft/ is git-ignored (regenerable local cache),
# but its markdown nodes are exactly what we want semantic search over:
# graft supplies exact file:line wiring, lore supplies the semantic recall.
!graft/
!graft/**/*.md

# ...except the machinery, which is bulk, not meaning.
graft/.cache/
graft/.graph/
